     <p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style="position:absolute;z-index:1;margin-left:708.0000px;margin-top:5.8667px;width:588.0000px;height:2.0000px"><img width="588" height="2" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/themes/default/images/spacer.gif" style="background:url(http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/themes/default/images/word.gif) no-repeat center center;border:1px solid #ddd" /></span><span style="position:absolute;z-index:1;margin-left:708.0000px;margin-top:5.8667px;width:588.0000px;height:2.0000px"><img width="588" height="2" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/themes/default/images/spacer.gif" style="background:url(http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/themes/default/images/word.gif) no-repeat center center;border:1px solid #ddd" /></span><span style="position:absolute;z-index:1;margin-left:708.0000px;margin-top:5.8667px;width:588.0000px;height:2.0000px"><img width="588" height="2" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/themes/default/images/spacer.gif" style="background:url(http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/themes/default/images/word.gif) no-repeat center center;border:1px solid #ddd" /></span><span style="position:absolute;z-index:1;margin-left:708.0000px;margin-top:5.8667px;width:588.0000px;height:2.0000px"><img width="588" height="2" src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/themes/default/images/spacer.gif" style="background:url(http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/themes/default/images/word.gif) no-repeat center center;border:1px solid #ddd" /></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 华文中宋;font-size: 29px">中共绍兴市第一中学委员会</span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 华文中宋;font-size: 29px">关于在全校组织开展庆祝建党</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 华文中宋;font-size: 29px">101</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 华文中宋;font-size: 29px">周年</span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center;line-height:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 华文中宋;font-size: 29px">系列活动的通知</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 43px;line-height: 37px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">为隆重庆祝中国共产党成立</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">101</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">周年，根据</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">市教育局党委</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">总体</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">部署安排，决定</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">于</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">2022<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">七一</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">前后</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">在全</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">校</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">组织</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">各党支部和全体</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:-0;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">党员</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:21px">教师，</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">开展</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">“</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">明</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">悟初心守根脉、</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">聚焦育人</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">办实事</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">庆祝建党</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">101</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">周年</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">系列活动。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 21px;">一、 </span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family:黑体">指导思想</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">深入</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，深刻领会习近平总书记系列重要讲话精神和历次到浙江考察调研时对各项工作的重要指示批示精神，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">全面贯彻</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">省第十五次党代会精神、</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">市</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">第</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">九次</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">党代会的决策部署</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，通过</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">开展</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">悟初心守根脉、聚合力办实事</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">系列活动</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">回顾</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">101</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年来党的光辉历程，弘扬党的丰功伟绩，激励和动员广大党员</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">教师</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">为</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">推进</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">我</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">校教育事业</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">高质量发展</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">、</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">建设</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">“</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">共同富裕</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">”视野下的“窗口示范校”</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;letter-spacing:-0;font-size:21px">贡献智慧力量</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 21px;">二、 </span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family:黑体">活动时间</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">20</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">22</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年</span>6<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月至</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">7</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月上旬</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 21px;">三、 </span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family:黑体">活动内容</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（一）组织一次集中学习活动（</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">6<span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">月至</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">7</span><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">月</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">）</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">。</span></strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">深入学习贯彻习近平总书记寄语教育发展的相关重要论述</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">精神</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，聚焦</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“加强党对教育工作的全面领导”“坚持立德树人”“全面深化教育领域综合改革”“建强教师队伍”等重要内容，立足我校“为党育人，为国育才”职能职责，组织全体党员教师认真学习领会习近平总书记讲话精神，进一步提升修德育人的思想境界和岗位建功的干劲热情，以实际行动践行“教育共富”的使命担当。（党委理论中心组、全体在职党支部）</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（二）举行一次主题党日活动（</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">6<span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">月至</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">7</span><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">月</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">）。</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">各党</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">支部</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">要围绕</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">明</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">悟初心守根脉、</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">聚焦育人</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">办实事</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">主题，开展形式多样、内容丰富的主题党日活动。可采用重温入党誓词，参观红色教育基地，开展党史、新中国史、改革开放史、社会主义发展史教育等形式，组织党员学习光辉历史，汲取信念养分，促使党员不忘初心、牢记使命，大力营造</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">“为党育人，为国育才”“立德树人”</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">的浓厚氛围。</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">校党委班子成员</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">要以普通党员身份参加所在党支部的组织生活。</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（全体在职党支部）</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（三）开展一次专题党课宣讲（</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">7<span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">日前后</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">）。</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">根据上级总体部署安排，及时开展省第十五次党代会专题培训。</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">视期末情况，统筹安排各</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">党支部集中上党课</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">专题党课</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">也</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">可与支部主题党日活动结合进行</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">）</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">校党委委员</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">要带头到所在党支部或联系（分管）</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">处室、年级</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">组织讲党课。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">党课内容紧扣</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">喜迎二十大 奋进新征程</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">主题，带领广大党员群众深入学习习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想，领会掌握省第十五次党代会、市第九次党代会精神。</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（校党委、全体在职党支部）</span></p><h1 style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;page-break-after:avoid;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">四</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">）</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">挖掘一批党群先锋典型</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">（</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">7<span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">日前后</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">）。</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:normal;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">校党委聚焦</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“建强教师队伍”，在全校范围内组织做好各类推优评选，挖掘工作先进典型；各支部组</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">织开展</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">先锋</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:normal;font-size:21px">指数测评</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-size:21px">”</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:normal;font-size:21px">，评议推选学年度优秀党员，并积极亮旗展示风采。</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">各党</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:normal;font-size:21px">支部</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">深入挖掘一批在</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:normal;font-size:21px">教学一线</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">和服务</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:normal;font-size:21px">师生</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">前沿的实干</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:normal;font-size:21px">者</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、志愿者的先锋事迹和暖心故事，展现</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:normal;font-size:21px">一中</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">人形象，弘扬时代先锋精神。</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-weight:normal;font-size:21px">（校党委、各支部、工会、团委、年级组）</span></h1><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">五</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">）开展一轮</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">师生志愿</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">服务（</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">6<span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">月至</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">7</span><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">月</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">）。</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">深化推进</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">三服务</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">工作，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">组织党员</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">教师</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">开展一轮集中</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">家校沟通</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">服务</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">聚焦</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“三特”学生帮扶，准确回应学生心灵需求</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">把准学生家长诉求，对不同年级学生的不同需要，落实</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“个性化服务清单”。各支部要充分发挥学科专业优势和丰富育人经验，协同年级组开展“高一选课指导”“高二学考辅导”“高三高校志愿填报帮扶”等多样化服务。要立足校园疫情防控</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">发挥党员先锋模范作用</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（全体在职党支部）</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">六</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">）</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">组织</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">一</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">次退休党员活动</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">6<span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">月至</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">7</span><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">月</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">）。</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">继续</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">深化推进</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">我校离退休支部</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">“</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">银领五星示范党支部</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">”</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">创建</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">工作，</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">在离退休党支部届满后按</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">组织</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">程序规范做好离退休党支部换届工作。要结合学校</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“养新”党建品牌建设，抓住重要节点契机，开拓“银领工程”丰富内涵</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">从</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">“关心下一代成长”的角度，充分调动老教师、老党员的育人热情，强化老同志“离岗不离党、退休不褪色”的优秀作风，组织退休老党员参观诸暨枫桥经验陈列馆，聘任部分老教师、老党员为第二批校外网格员、调解员。（离退休支部）</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">七</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">）</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">落实</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">一次暖心慰问活动（</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">6<span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">月底</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 楷体_GB2312;font-size: 21px">至放假</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">前</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">）。</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">重点聚焦</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">建国前入党、党龄</span>50<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年以上</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、年龄</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">70<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">周岁以上老党员、</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">生活困难及独居老党员等群体，组织</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">在职党支部、各学科组</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">有序开展慰问，送上党的温暖，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">切实解决老党员生活中存在的困难问题。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">对一些生活特别困难老党员，要</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">组建结对帮扶小组，常态化开展结对帮扶工作。</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">（校党委、各支部、学科组）</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 21px;">四、 </span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family:黑体">工作要求</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312;font-weight:bold;font-size:21px">（一）</span><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">加强</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">组织领导。</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">校</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">党委</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">班子</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">要扛起组织的</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">主体责任，充分发挥党支部</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">积极</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">作用</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，调动党员的主观能动性，利用好</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">三会一课</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、主题党日等形式，开展各类活动</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。各</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">处室</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">各年级、</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">各</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">学科组</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">要充分发挥好党建</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">引领</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">党建融合</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">等的作用，形成全员参与、共建共庆的生动局面。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（二）注重活动实效。</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">按照</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">突出特色，贴近群众</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">的原则，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">精心组织好系列活动</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，努力增强</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">庆祝</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">活动的教育意义和感染力、说服力。要严格落实</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">上级</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">规定，防止形式主义，</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">要立足学校教育教学工作实际，力求活动有魅力、有意义、有实效</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（三）强化宣传引导。</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">各支部</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">要充分发挥广大党员的主动性，把活动延伸至</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">学生及其家庭</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">充分调动线上线下两个阵地的作用发挥，</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">积极营造浓厚的庆祝氛围，在参与庆祝活动中激发党员自豪感和凝聚力。要对</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">庆祝</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">建党</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">101</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">周年活动情况进行广泛宣传</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">要切实把好导向，加强舆论引导，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">积极传播正能量，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">造浓活动氛围，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">及时</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">上报</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">相关</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">活动</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">信息</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">各</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">支部</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">开展</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">庆祝</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">建党</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">101</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">周年系列活动的基本情况请于</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">7</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">10</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">日前报</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">党政办</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">，如有特色做法和工作亮点，请即时报送。联系人：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">余栋材</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">，联系电话：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">18006755867</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"> </span></p><p style=";text-align:right;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">中共绍兴市</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">第一中学委员会</span></p><p style="text-indent:341px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:right;line-height:37px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">2022</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年</span>6<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">15</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">日</span></span></p><p style="text-align:right"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p>
</p>
    
